        "value": "如果您不在中华人民共和国，您必须在使用本电子书之前查看您所在国家/地区的法律。",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 36,
        "value": "什么是公版书？",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 37,
        "value": "根据我国现行「著作权法」第 20、21 条的规定，除署名权、修改权、保护作品完整权外，中国公民对其著作的法定权利均于作者死亡后第五十年的 12 月 31 日截止。超过著作权法保护日期后，其作品就进入了公有领域（公共版权）",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 38,
        "value": "这种因作者死亡超过 50 年而丧失发行权、改编权等著作权利的书籍，就称为“公共版权书籍”，简称“公版书”。",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 39,
        "value": "中华文明5000多年绵延不断、经久不衰，在长期演进过程中，形成了中国人看待世界、看待社会、看待人生的独特价值体系、文化内涵和精神品质，这是我们区别于其他国家和民族的根本特征，也铸就了中华民族博采众长的文化自信。",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 40,
        "value": "文化是一个国家、一个民族的灵魂。文化兴国运兴，文化强民族强。",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 41,
        "value": "使用文硕阁网站中的公版书不需要获得许可（在中国，这属于“合理使用”）。这适用于所有用途，包括商业用途。换句话说，即使是商业盈利用途，也无需支付版税。",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 42,
        "value": "我们希望可以有更多的用户加入到传硕计划中来，让我们一起来保护传承文明的硕果。",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 43,
        "value": "源浚者流长，根深者叶茂。文化自信是一个国家、一个民族发展中最基本、最深沉、最持久的力量。",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 44,
        "value": "如何联系我们？",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "block": 45,
        "value": "网站：www.wenshuoge.com",
        "reason": "Repeated whole-book navigation/EPUBguide and producer boilerplate, not ancient text. All original bytes preserved in before/20.json."
